<Base title="Test your router — Heimdall" description="How to report whether Heimdall works with your router." current="Contribute">
  <div class="wrap hero"><div class="eyebrow">Contribute</div><h1>Test your router</h1>
    <p class="lede">Pick your router on the Equipment tab, make it the primary router, and note what shows up.</p>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li><div>Install Heimdall and open the <strong>Equipment</strong> tab.</div></li>
      <li><div>Choose your router family, enter its login, and save.</div></li>
      <li><div>Check what appears: devices, signal, ports. Try blocking a test device you own.</div></li>
      <li><div>Open an issue using the router-test template in the repository and tell us what worked, what did not, and your firmware version. Remove addresses and serial numbers first.</div></li>
    </ol>
    <p class="muted">The full guide is in <a href="https://github.com/danielonet/heimdall/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md#help-test-your-router">CONTRIBUTING.md</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
